  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_01",
      "hash64": "F80DCD9BF3F4D6BC",
      "text": "Hola, clase. Me llamo Hesperio y seré vuestro\\nprofesor de Arte.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_02",
      "hash64": "F80DD09BF3F4DBD5",
      "text": "Pero, antes de nada, debo formular la pregunta\\nobligada: ¿qué es el arte?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_03",
      "hash64": "F80DCF9BF3F4DA22",
      "text": "Probablemente, algo que la mayoría de vosotros\\nolvidaréis por completo en el momento en que\\r\\nos graduéis.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_04",
      "hash64": "F80DCA9BF3F4D1A3",
      "text": "Al fin y al cabo, entre los exámenes, la búsqueda\\nde empleo y demás obligaciones mundanas, algo\\r\\nde valor puramente estético como el arte no\\r\\ntiene cabida.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_05",
      "hash64": "F80DC99BF3F4CFF0",
      "text": "De lo cual se deduce que mi asignatura es,\\na todas luces, simple y llanamente inútil, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "F80DCC9BF3F4D509",
      "text": "Pues os equivocáis. O eso me gustaría pensar,\\nal menos.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_07",
      "hash64": "F80DCB9BF3F4D356",
      "text": "Os invito a realizar un ejercicio de reflexión.\\c\\nDecidme: a vuestro juicio, ¿qué define el arte?\\n¿Qué diferencia algo bello de algo que no lo es?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_f_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "1A79702FE1688C5D",
      "text": "El color y la forma",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_f_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "1A796D2FE1688744",
      "text": "Es cuestión de gustos",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_f_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "1A796E2FE16888F7",
      "text": "Ni idea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_answer_01",
      "hash64": "8535359B48B5456D",
      "text": "Hmm... Conque eso piensas, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_08",
      "hash64": "F80DD69BF3F4E607",
      "text": "Obviamente, no existe una única respuesta\\ncorrecta. Lo que importa en realidad es\\r\\nreflexionar y cuestionarse las cosas.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_09",
      "hash64": "F80DD59BF3F4E454",
      "text": "Imaginemos un camino flanqueado por flores.\\nConvendríamos en que son bellas, que nos\\r\\ninspiran bellas sensaciones. ¿Pero por qué?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_10",
      "hash64": "F80A489BF3F1BEE6",
      "text": "Observad el cielo y el mar, ambos azules y, sin\\nembargo, de distinto matiz. O la infinita gama\\r\\nde tonos de los árboles...\\c\\nEl giro del molino de Pueblo Altamía, las frías\\naguas de Ciudad Cántara... Todo ello invita\\r\\na cuestionar y a reflexionar.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 219,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 252,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_11",
      "hash64": "F80A499BF3F1C099",
      "text": "Esto nos permite percibir todo cuanto nos rodea\\ncon una mayor intensidad y profundidad.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_12",
      "hash64": "F80A469BF3F1BB80",
      "text": "Así, cuando estéis agotados por los estudios o se\\npresente alguna adversidad en vuestras labores...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_13",
      "hash64": "F80A479BF3F1BD33",
      "text": "Podría proporcionaros ese pequeño espaldarazo\\nque necesitaréis para avanzar.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_14",
      "hash64": "F80A4C9BF3F1C5B2",
      "text": "Soy consciente de que no es algo sencillo de\\nexplicar con palabras, así que no os obsesionéis\\r\\nsi no sois capaces de entenderlo a la perfección.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_15",
      "hash64": "F80A4D9BF3F1C765",
      "text": "El arte no es necesario para la vida, pero sí la\\nhace mucho más dichosa.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_16",
      "hash64": "F80A4A9BF3F1C24C",
      "text": "Si logro dar a vuestra vida una somera pincelada\\nde color siquiera, podré darme por satisfecho.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_17",
      "hash64": "F80A4B9BF3F1C3FF",
      "text": "En la próxima lección hablaremos del arte con un\\nenfoque un tanto más pragmático. ¡Podéis iros![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
